  "project_description": "Back to top \n\n Introduction \n News Ticker provides a configurable scrolling news ticker for supported Drupal 10.6 and Drupal 11.3+ sites.\n\n Back to top \n\n Features \n \n Validated news lists and items with hardened access and error handling. \n A reusable block with responsive layout, keyboard focus behavior, pause controls, and reduced-motion support. \n Administrator-only design controls for colors, typography, spacing, speed, icons, and layout. \n Optional custom CSS declarations protected by a strict allowlist sanitizer; selectors, at-rules, external resources, executable values, escapes, and !important are rejected. \n Automated functional/unit tests and PHP, JavaScript, CSS, spelling, Composer, and supported-version CI on every push. \n \n Back to top \n\n Requirements \n Drupal 10.6 or Drupal 11.3 and later.\n\n Back to top",
